  "prefLabel": "Mavs 201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mavs 201.01 Purpose. The department conducts proceedings for the purpose of acquiring sufficient information to make fair and reasonable decisions on matters within its statutory jurisdiction. The goal of these proceedings is to secure a just, efficient and accurate resolution.\n\nSource. #13459-A, eff 10-14-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mavs200.html"
